flowchart LR
  Query[Bound SELECT] --> Access[PhysicalAccess decision]
  Access --> Index{Usable index?}
  Index -->|yes| IndexScan[Index lookup / range access]
  Index -->|no| Scan[Table or source scan]
  IndexScan --> Operators[Joins, filters, aggregates, windows, projection]
  Scan --> Operators
  Operators --> Merge[Merge visible versions and tombstones]
  Merge --> Rows[Typed result rows]
